<p> Net interest income		 3,410    3,375  3,450   3,299</p>
<p> Non-interest income		 1,493    1,440  1,620   1,316</p>
<p> Non-interest expenses	     3,176    3,015  3,258   2,937</p>
<p> Operating profit before losses  1,732    1,598  1,890   1,678</p>
<p> Pre-tax operating profit	  1,864    1,770  2,040   2,785</p>
<p> EPS 1996				  3.4     3.2    3.7</p>
